--- !u!114 &6522630913224639119
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: ED_M.1/6
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Me interesa, Abraham./nY por ello, quiero ayudarle./nMe hospedo en la posada
    Garrido./nAll\xED, se hospedaba la mujer que llevaba el colgante maldito en su
    cuello./nLo reconoc\xED al instante./nY s\xE9 qu\xE9 le sucedi\xF3 al chico./n"
  childrenIDs:
  - ED_M.1/7
  - ED_M.1/8
  - ED_M.1/9
  - 7
  - 8
  - 9
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1147
    y: 112
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 8288426215254106694, guid: a1347a34fee077c46bb4de37f94af7b4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &6890747182355584056
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: ED_M.1/11
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "El colgante lo mat\xF3./nEn cuesti\xF3n de horas, absorvi\xF3 toda la esperanza
    de vida del muchacho./nRedujo su cuerpo a una masa reseca y \xE1spera, como el
    tronco de un \xE1rbol./nFui a ver el cad\xE1ver con mis propios ojos cuando me
    enter\xE9 de lo ocurrido."
  childrenIDs:
  - ED_M.1/12
  - 12
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1892
    y: 191
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: -5009680308845635104, guid: a1347a34fee077c46bb4de37f94af7b4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &7064969323689532091
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: ED_M.1/4
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Ya veo. Eso es bueno./nEl alma de ese chico merece que se haga justicia./n\xBFY
    usted?/n\xBFHar\xE1 justicia?"
  childrenIDs:
  - ED_M.1/6
  - 6
